  {
    "name": "Ingress",
    "tags": [
      {
        "name": "Ingress",
        "description": "Webhook receivers for connected services. Deliberately unauthenticated in\nthe bearer sense: the signature verified against the connection's sealed\nsecret **is** the authentication, and nothing is stored before it\nverifies.\n",
        "operations": [
          {
            "id": "receiveWebhook",
            "method": "POST",
            "path": "/v1/ingress/{provider}/{connection_id}",
            "summary": "Receive a connected-service webhook",
            "description": "Unauthenticated in the bearer sense **by design**: the signature\nverified against the connection's sealed secret is the authentication,\nand nothing is stored before it verifies.\n\nThe pipeline is provider-ignorant — ingress, verify, normalize, match,\ncreate run, publish — with all provider knowledge behind a single\ndispatch.\n\nRetries are safe and in fact *healing*: two database-unique dedup levels\n(delivery per connection, dispatch per subscription) mean a retry\ncompletes a partial fan-out rather than duplicating runs or comments.\n\nA pull request from a fork freezes `trust_tier: read_only`, enforced at\nthe permission gate above policy and above human approval. The check\nfails toward \"fork\" when the head repository is hidden.\n",
            "security": [],
            "public": true
          },
          {
            "id": "receiveGithubAppWebhook",
            "method": "POST",
            "path": "/v1/ingress/github/app/{registration_id}",
            "summary": "Receive an app-level GitHub webhook",
            "description": "App-level ingress, verified against the **registration's** sealed\nwebhook secret. The connection is resolved from the verified payload's\ninstallation id and fed into the same pipeline as connection-level\ningress.\n\nLifecycle database failures answer `5xx` on purpose so GitHub retries —\nnever swallow-and-acknowledge.\n",
            "security": [],
            "public": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
